<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Commercial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Commercial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Wheat First Butcher Singer analyst John Maxwell said he reiterated his buy rating on Standard Commercial Corp and added the stock to the brokerage's action list.</p>
<p>-- He said the move came after the company said on Monday it saw its fiscal year 1997 earnings per share at $1.75-$1.80 and its FY98 EPS at $2.25-$2.35.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The company looks like it is in extremely good shape and has one of the lowest multiples in the group,&quot; Maxwell said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3-1/2 at 17-1/2.</p>
</text>
